            "body": {
              "serial": "i5f2c6d0b530b7",
              "body": "<p>{{i5f2c6d0b531ae}} was a real piss-ant who was very rarely stable.<br\/>\n{{i5f2c6d0b532e5}}, Heidegger was a boozy beggar who could think you under the table.<br\/>\n{{i5f2c6d0b53410}} could out-consume {{i5f2c6d0b53545}}.<br\/>\nAnd {{i5f2c6d0b53665}} was a beery swine who was just as sloshed as {{i5f2c6d0b5377f}}.<\/p>",
